            e094060c57634de8 t("The mark's light, a task's ring and a subagent's robot keep paces of their own: 2.4 seconds for an agent's sweep, 3.6 for what goes on in the background, the ring and the robot included, and 4.8 for a workspace being set up. Each moves only while its work goes on.",SF Pro Text,14,r,align(l),lh(1.6071),ls(-0.1498px)) p(0,26.5) s(fill,hug:45) ext(888,) f[(a773d02b4173cb71,tok(color.text.muted,#B8B1AC))] $typography.Body "Purpose"
